                                                "sense_id": "53f23820-11d3-3847-ad0a-df410af8a8d1",
                                                "text": "In both the all-in-ones and the pocket styles, the lining is sewn at the edges to the waterproof outer cover, with the seam covered in a soft but robust border fabric so it fits snugly against the baby's legs and middle."
                                            },
                                            {
